{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "7a21a179f504d0da90baeaacd8e9e5349f38c000dedb6c93aa890c8865df3d76", "ja": "ジュリアー！！", "zh": "茱莉亚──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "42b3a558eb825c3d685c038544382f72c22b2cd8cc3235aefeddd916982e5b34", "ja": "うわっ、びっくりした！？\n昴、のり子も……どうしたんだよ？", "zh": "呜哇，吓我一跳！\n是昴和法子……怎么了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "768d44e8600b67ee2b2c436068ec03cd7faf88b258cf2798924844fa178aa3b4", "ja": "すっげー、最高だった！\nジュリア、めちゃくちゃカッコよかったよ！", "zh": "好神喔，太棒了！\n茱莉亚，你超帅的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "f33cf261d9b2d267720f5e8c101da215b64c6a9adc5a772ced3431cf0ddd5133", "ja": "本当だよ！　なんか最終ラウンドで思いっきり\nKO負けしちゃった気分だよ！　このこのぉ～！", "zh": "真的！感觉好像在最后一回合被漂亮KO一样！\n厉害喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "b00c61ab52551c61106fe406dcfbdbe924dd856e29923bb1b4ca3d371a9082a4", "ja": "ジュリアちゃん、よく頑張ったで賞をあげちゃいます！\nドンドンドンパフー♪", "zh": "小茱莉亚，颁给你认真努力奖！\n咚咚咚咚叭噗～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "ce46453e3272b9c69dab8356355ef322e100dcbf836e8c4bc09ac54a8db9ff69", "ja": "うん……ジュリアちゃん、本当にかっこよかった。\nロックってすごいんだね……。", "zh": "嗯……茱莉亚，你真的很帅气。\n摇滚好厉害喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1011_p", "source_sha256": "eae257f798e2d36848f3dac9f8c545424fce123fc6ad9743b965e397dff1be71", "ja": "うん、正に『ロックなアイドル』だったよ。\nよくやったな、ジュリア！", "zh": "嗯，这正是所谓的『摇滚偶像』喔。\n做得真好，茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "1f40694bc22eeaec24ca9d7eeed71427fc7b9193b17ac705f6e9da04cffea006", "ja": "あ……いや……まあ、な……。\nそ、そう言ってもらえると、うん……。", "zh": "啊……不……好吧……\n听、听你们这么说，嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "0941e2d2164d5a8bed6c9dcde58467ea80bcda31f7eceea67c2e68075f9aee07", "ja": "あれれ？　ジュリアちゃん、お顔が真っ赤だよ。\nどうかしたの？", "zh": "奇怪啰～？小茱莉亚，你脸超红的耶。\n发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "f094c8884bf80a2318eddc6c6f4348ef81063a5ba6657ea24a992be763b35bc6", "ja": "べべべ、別に赤くなんかなってないっての！\nからかうな、レイ！", "zh": "我我我、我才没有脸红！\n丽，别开我玩笑啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "5c9ba1bab2819b1151690296ca0ecced50880410027bde7fdae4347b6c23c53b", "ja": "ふふっ！　はーい、ごめんなさーい！", "zh": "呵呵！好～对不起啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "320ca8d0a274c84d7d76990b9f7b5fba292d29c13dcda26855a2e6ead7bafdf2", "ja": "えっと……改めて、みんな本当にサンキュ。\n今日のステージ、最後はひとりだったけど……。", "zh": "那个……我正式说一次，真的很谢谢大家。\n今天表演的最后一首歌虽然让我独唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "af6a6a28a4236c86a615000a62366f2a323739c21825f7b96a158f5431b6f03b", "ja": "ひとりで歌ってても、あたしはひとりじゃなかった。\n仲間の存在を、たしかに感じてたんだ。", "zh": "但即使是独唱，我却不孤单，\n因为我深刻感受到有伙伴陪伴在身边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "683be2e456799938c06a681447306f0f7313923e8b797f1947271455aa407b48", "ja": "最後の曲が歌えたのも、みんなと一緒に、\nここまで駆け抜けてきたからだ。本当に感謝してる！", "zh": "我之所以能唱出最后一首歌，也是因为这些日子\n和大家一路携手冲刺到这里，真的很感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "c7a7cf6b65db26309df7492069129bbd84ecd1dd6fd4d05f70b9e91fea3e8668", "ja": "ジュリアちゃん……ううん。私たちのほうこそ、\nありがとう。とっても楽しかったよ！", "zh": "茱莉亚……不是的，我们才要向你道谢，\n今天的演唱会很开心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "1760380b666150ddc32df5219c0d1906da4e5f9c871d12205dbad7c7a478ff4d", "ja": "ならよかった！　しんみりした空気は苦手なんだ。\nさっさと着替えて、パァーッと打ち上げでも……。", "zh": "那就好！气氛太感性我会有点不自在。\n我们快去换衣服，热热闹闹地办个庆功宴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1021_p", "source_sha256": "665302fc47728fbbe9cbf8781df9c1632c83cb0da453e62df0b38299d1502009", "ja": "残念だけど、それはもう少し後みたいだな。", "zh": "很遗憾，那可能要再等一会儿了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "bb5b6b956394f03f3f864a7a6470eda62fecb7b72d67c4fa28f045813666f2f1", "ja": "は？　なんでだよ……あ。", "zh": "什么？为什么啊……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1023_audience", "source_sha256": "46916ff0e56e721daaae35b1569628199b7c21845657497927aabb8ad85d3a7b", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！　アンコール！", "zh": "安可！安可！安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "b24319ee5b526ecd56518b8c5574c3295002a0e5b2ed6afd85cf6c72d2ec5c71", "ja": "お客さんのリクエストじゃ、仕方ないな～。\n延長ラウンド、行けるよね？", "zh": "既然是观众的要求就没办法了～\n还有体力打延长赛吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "c9178c3d0f547b740e289802ba5d5da1175b44c8f152ccf3240fc972b12d89a9", "ja": "ピッチャー交代はなしだぜ、ジュリア。\n最後まで投げきらないとな！", "zh": "可不能中途换投喔，茱莉亚。\n一定要投到最后才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_041_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_041_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "748a42d8053abd99257a6d06d3b5aef2c5dc9fb636ceeacf56b60111f6f30a3d", "ja": "ああ。……この歓声は、みんなで作り上げたもの。\nだからアンコールは、全員でだ！", "zh": "是啊……这欢呼声是大家一起创造的，\n所以我们大家要一起唱安可曲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
